<title>LATVIA: SALACGRIVA UNAUDITED 1996 PROFIT 200,000 LATS.</title>
<headline>SALACGRIVA UNAUDITED 1996 PROFIT 200,000 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fish cannery Salacgriva95 said on Friday its unaudited profit for 1996 was 200,000 lats against 6,000 lats in the six months of 1995.</p>
<p>Food group Ave Lat, which controls Salacgriva95, said that the fish cannery's turnover came to 3.4 million lats compared to 627,000 lats for the second half of 1996.</p>
<p>Salacgriva's assets rose to 1.6 million lats from 992,000.</p>
<p>&quot;The company started functioning in the present shape only since July of 1995, which explains the lack of full-year comparatives,&quot; an Ave Lat spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
